{"name":"Nostalgia","hex":"#d6b8bd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"nostalgia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A longing for home or familiar surroundings; homesickness. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A bittersweet yearning for the things of the past."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nostalgia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nostalgia","blocks":[{"text":"Nostalgia is an emotion which is often described as a bittersweet longing for the past, typically for a period of time accompanied by happy memories or emotions. It is often described as a sort of sad pleasure, which typically involves longing for a past memory, whether real or romanticized, that cannot be recovered. It can also refer to a type of homesickness."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/SaturdayEveningPost30Aug1924.jpg/330px-SaturdayEveningPost30Aug1924.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nostalgia","wikidata":"Q12151852"},{"title":"Nostalgia (Rod Wave album)","blocks":[{"text":"Nostalgia is the fifth studio album by American rapper and singer Rod Wave, released on September 15, 2023, through Alamo Records. The album features guest appearances from 21 Savage, Sadie Jean, and Wet, while the production was handled by Ayo Bleu, FlexOnDaTrack, LayZBeats, LondnBlue, Ronny J, SephGotTheWaves, and TnTXD, alongside several others. The album serves as a follow-up to Green's fourth studio album, Beautiful Mind (2022), and his EP, Jupiter's Diary: 7 Day Theory (2022)."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/65/Rod_Wave_-_Nostalgia.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nostalgia_(Rod_Wave_album)","wikidata":"Q122663160"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/500px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/1280px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg/500px-Tweed_run_20130413_180.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Tweed run, 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATweed_run_20130413_180.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/500px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/1280px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/98/Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg/500px-Vintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Rider in vintage clothing astride a vintage BSA motorcycle on High Street in Honiton, England, in July 2023","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVintage_BSA_motorcycle.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/La_Laitemaire.jpg/500px-La_Laitemaire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/La_Laitemaire.jpg/1280px-La_Laitemaire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/La_Laitemaire.jpg/500px-La_Laitemaire.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A rural landscape in Vaud, Switzerland. The term \"nostalgia\" originally referred to the homesickness felt by Swiss